        STG --> MART[mart_* schemas\nstar schemas per domain]
        MART --> RPT[reporting_* schemas\npresentation-ready views]
    end

    subgraph Exports["📦 Exports (data/exports/)"]
        E1[Parquet files per reporting schema]
    end

    subgraph PowerBI["📊 Power BI (powerbi/)"]
        PB1[.pbip + Report + SemanticModel\nper reporting domain]
    end

    DOM["📋 Insurance Domains\nclaim acc. snapshot · claim periodic snapshot\npolicy transactions · accident events\npremium periodic snapshot · consolidated"]

    G1 & G2 & G3 & G4 & G5 -->|generate Parquet| RawData
    RawData --> DLT
    DLT --> S_RAW

    RPT -->|export_reporting.py| E1
    E1 -->|generate_powerbi.py| PB1

    MART & RPT -.->|covers| DOM

